WebAssembly plug-ins run in the wasmi interpreter (MIT OR Apache-2.0); its wasmparser dependency is
under the Apache License 2.0 with the LLVM exception.

The .cdr reader (crates/cdr) reads the record layouts that the Kaitai Struct specification
coreldraw_cdr.ksy (https://github.com/kaitai-io/coreldraw_cdr.ksy, MIT License) and its fork by Zach
Wolfe (https://github.com/filestar/coreldraw_cdr.ksy, branch new_stuff, MIT License) describe. No part
of either specification is copied into the crate; the license text is in crates/cdr/LICENSE-kaitai.txt.

